      "en": "“Indeed, all the Jews know my way of life from my youth up, which was from the beginning among my own nation and at Jerusalem;",
      "ko": "내가 처음부터 내 민족 중에와 예루살렘에서 젊었을 때 생활한 상태를 유대인이 다 아는바라",
      "source_text_hash": "5a65521b901b942de1e9eba102d7752eb073ea881ea6ac4a6a2208af4ca153f1",
      "translation_text_hash": "9a319cb96398000ac9ed7bc57906b1f57bccebb7c274c53c0f31a2d05f83934d",
